WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.032
Let's line them up.

00:00:01.323 --> 00:00:03.958
Here's the codon A-U-G on the mRNA.

00:00:04.678 --> 00:00:07.871
Here's a tRNA with the anticodon U-A-C.

00:00:08.207 --> 00:00:09.322
A pairs with U.

00:00:09.949 --> 00:00:11.226
U pairs with A.

00:00:11.563 --> 00:00:12.828
G pairs with C.

00:00:13.455 --> 00:00:15.185
All three match, so they bind.

00:00:15.812 --> 00:00:18.029
This tRNA carries methionine.

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.317
Like matching each letter to its partner.

00:00:20.943 --> 00:00:22.488
Now try the question again.
